From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:40:23 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] AMLCapture: capture the GUI from the vdin1 OSD1 input

Without video the session captures nothing, so a GUI capture needs a
full framebuffer read on the render thread. The vdin1 OSD1 loopback
input carries the GUI at the output rate, scaled by vdin.
